{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/1b485ecdda00253ddf779fe644807421.avif?t=1754640481\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude90 <strong>Fries Drive \u2013 A Cozy Food Truck Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fries Drive</strong> is a charming cooking simulation game where you run your very own street food van combining relaxing exploration with fast-paced, first-person cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through a peaceful little world from a <strong>top-down isometric view</strong>, park in busy areas, and hop into your compact kitchen to <strong>cut, fry, and serve fresh potato fries</strong>. Once you park, the action shifts to <strong>immersive first-person mode</strong>, where timing is everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're slicing potatoes, racing against the clock, or managing impatient customers, Fries Drive delivers a satisfying blend of cozy atmosphere and time-management challenge one crispy fry at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/d0433076c4751151de939b85a111ea90.avif?t=1754640481\" width=200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the road in your trusty <strong>food truck</strong> and explore different neighborhoods filled with hungry customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corners, avoid traffic, and get to the next stop before time runs out!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant districts with unique customer types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master <strong>time management</strong> as you juggle driving and cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your truck for better speed, handling, and more fryers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/be3f62296ecebd1153084fae332b8ea5.poster.avif?t=1754640481\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/be3f62296ecebd1153084fae332b8ea5.webm?t=1754640481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/be3f62296ecebd1153084fae332b8ea5.mp4?t=1754640481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/5c41d3a0ec6807bef79bf61feb3d8393.avif?t=1754640481\" width=200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you park, it\u2019s time to get to work! Toss fries into the fryer, add the right sauce, and make sure every order is perfect. Customers are impatient, and burnt fries mean bad reviews!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>first-person cooking gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulfill detailed orders with sauces like ketchup, mayo, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve fast or watch your customers leave unhappy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/8f79945c69d6768889c79883f1a56ba2.poster.avif?t=1754640481\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/8f79945c69d6768889c79883f1a56ba2.webm?t=1754640481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/extras/8f79945c69d6768889c79883f1a56ba2.mp4?t=1754640481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Cozy Vibes &amp; Chill Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fries Drive is designed for players who love relaxing games <i>with just a pinch of pressure</i>. Bright visuals, soft world ambience, and satisfying gameplay loops make this the perfect game to chill with \u2014 but don\u2019t get too comfortable... customers are waiting!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Top-down driving through a stylized world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Balance calm vibes with time pressure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Low-poly visuals and cozy aesthetic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progression through upgrades and efficiency</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Relaxing yet challenging food truck simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 First-person cooking + isometric exploration hybrid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Simple controls, satisfying systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Cozy, colorful visuals and sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Detailed order system with sauces and fry timing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Perfect for fans of cooking games, simulators, and cozy management experiences</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897690?t=1754640481","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897690?t=1754640481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897690/87b3a63386f0de2489c2ff90a6149cecb685ca25/capsule_231x87.j